  "chapter_note": "This chunk closes the beast material with a tight Ezekiel 4 reading and a clean return to the food-law similitude of chewing the cud. Short paragraphs, law-positive density, and intact scripture markup are strengths; the Hosea parallel and the two-assemblies contrast land cleanly. The sole clear defect is residual presenter staging in the recap sentence that begins “You have now watched.” That line violates the ban on director cues and should be recast as a plain assertion. No sentence-open violations, AI vocabulary, or quote errors appear. The glossary pointer works as a natural exit.",
